**Summary:** Calculates baseline firing rate statistics during the presample epoch (from -0.5 sec to sample event time). For each cluster and condition, bins spikes with smoothing. Returns median firing rate and standard deviation across time points, resulting in arrays of shape [nUnits × nConditions]. Used for baseline normalization.

