params.prep = [-2.5 -0.05]; % initial and final time points (seconds) defining prep epoch, relative to alignevent
params.move = [-2.5 1.5];   % initial and final time points (seconds) defining move epoch, relative to alignevent
% params.advance_movement = 0.025; % seconds, amount of time to advance movement data relative to neural data
params.advance_movement = 0.0;

end
```

**Summary:** Sets default parameters for data processing. Key parameters: alignment event (goCue), firing rate threshold (0.5 Hz), time window (-2.5 to +2.5 sec), bin size (5 ms, dt=1/200), smoothing (15 ms Gaussian), trial conditions (right/left hits, with/without autowater, excluding early licks). Includes video feature lists and epoch definitions (prep: -2.5 to -0.05 sec; move: -2.5 to +1.5 sec).

